null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No pytest/mypy seam applies to infrastructure code, so checks run through pyinfra's own execution engine: Tier 1 --dry (prepare-phase estimate), Tier 2 disposable systemd-capable containers over @ssh (not @docker, which has no init system), Tier 3 running the same Deploy twice to confirm zero pending operations on the second run."}, {"id": "pyinfra_readme_typed_settings_pattern", "label": "Typed pydantic-settings config pattern", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "pyinfra/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Real addresses/secrets/refs are read from the dev machine's environment at Deploy time via typed pydantic-settings classes rather than each Deploy file parsing os.environ by hand; required settings are constructed lazily inside has_device_role guards so running one Deploy file in isolation never demands env vars an unrelated one needs."}], "edges": [{"source": "pyinfra_readme_doc", "target": "context_md_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pyinfra/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pyinfra_readme_doc", "target": "docs_agents_pyinfra_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pyinfra/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pyinfra_readme_deploy_pi_api_py", "target": "pyinfra_readme_api_deploy_py", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pyinfra/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pyinfra_readme_deploy_server_api_py", "target": "pyinfra_readme_api_deploy_py", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "pyinfra/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"sour